# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: iderunboard
# board: discover
# A program runs ON THE BOARD and is watched here.
#
# The editor offers the board the shell has mounted, hands the program
# to its interpreter, and what the board prints arrives in the SAME
# message window a run on this machine fills -- because it is the same
# interpreter, and the rows, the folded error and the caret are the
# same road.  A board's program is far slower than the host's, so the
# waits here are long on purpose.
wait 200
note connect devices through TikuDesktop before opening TikuBasic
click 264 8
wait 10
menu-pick Connect to nRF54LM20B
wait 300
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Development
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
expect-title Project
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
expect-title Open
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-no-title Open
note the board the shell mounted is offered by name, beside Run
click-window Project
wait 8
note the row the list stands on is the program with a mistake on a
note KNOWN line: what comes back has to name that line, which is the
note whole of what a message is for
key Down
wait 8
note choose the desktop default for subsequent runs and saves
click 264 8
wait 8
menu-pick Default device:
wait 8
menu-pick nrf54lm20b
wait 10
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu Run blink.bas on nrf54lm20b
menu-pick Run blink.bas on nrf54lm20b
note a board is slower than this machine by a long way
wait 600
note the window is made only when there is something to put in it, so
note its being here at all is the board's output having arrived
expect-title blink.bas on nrf54lm20b
note and the row IS what the board printed: a remote window's drawing
note cannot be narrated over the wire, so the row is read where a person
note would reach it, in the menu that offers to follow it
click-window blink.bas on nrf54lm20b
wait 8
note the rows themselves are not read here: a remote window's drawing
note cannot be narrated over the wire, and the row menu offers a place
note to go rather than the words.  What the row SAYS is held instead by
note test_boardbasic, against a board, where the two lines an error is
note printed in are checked as the editor folds them.
quit
